# GameStore Architecture

This is an ASP.NET Core GameStore modular monolith using **Vertical Slice Architecture**.

## Projects

- `GameStore.Api` — HTTP/application use cases (features organized by use case)
- `GameStore.Tests` — API integration tests
- `GameStore.React` — storefront SPA (React + TypeScript)
- Do not reorganize into Clean Architecture or Controller/Service/Repository layers

## Tech stack

- PostgreSQL + EF Core
- Keycloak locally; Entra ID in Azure
- Stripe for payments
- Azure Blob Storage for game images
- Azure Service Bus for asynchronous messaging

## Backend layout

- Use cases live under `Features/{Area}/{UseCase}/`
- Keep domain types under `Domain/`, persistence under `Persistence/`, integrations under `Integrations/`
- Keep unrelated features isolated; do not share code across slices unless there is a clear, current need
